      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Dig in more, I think the problem doesn't related to VRCUiShape component, it is quite weird that all 3 UI variants of VizVid not functioning on OB version, and one of those 3 didn't have a nested VRCUiShape hierarchy structure, so I think there is something else make that text component \"disappeared\".",
