      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found the root cause by changing the input and some logging!\n\nNormally, `text` property in text fields are safe to set null strings, but I think you guys injected some code to it (for the max string limit fix, I think) that assume the string provided never null, that's why it crashes when null is provided.\n\nYou can see how original implementation handles input text: https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/uGUI/blob/2019.1/UnityEngine.UI/UI/Core/Text.cs#L205-L211\n\nI can get around this by falling back null to empty strings before updating text, but this should be fixed in VRChat side as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
